"How do I start my first workout?" = "Como empiezo mi primer entreno?";
"Getting started is easy! Navigate to the Workouts tab, choose 'Recommended for You' section, and select a beginner-friendly workout. Each workout includes step-by-step instructions, video demonstrations, and progress tracking. Start with shorter sessions (15-20 minutes) and gradually increase duration as you build stamina." = "Empezar es facil. Ve a la pestaña Entreno, elige la seccion Recomendado para ti y selecciona un entreno para principiantes. Cada entreno incluye instrucciones paso a paso, videos y seguimiento de progreso. Empieza con sesiones cortas de 15-20 minutos y aumenta poco a poco.";
"Can I modify workouts for my fitness level?" = "Puedo modificar entrenos segun mi nivel?";
"Absolutely! All our workouts include modifications for different fitness levels. Look for the 'Modify' button during exercises to see easier or harder variations. You can also adjust weights, repetitions, and rest periods. Our AI adapts recommendations based on your performance and feedback." = "Claro. Todos los entrenos incluyen modificaciones para distintos niveles. Busca el boton Modificar durante los ejercicios para ver variaciones mas faciles o mas dificiles. Tambien puedes ajustar pesos, repeticiones y descansos.";
"How often should I work out?" = "Con que frecuencia debo entrenar?";
"For beginners, we recommend 3-4 workout sessions per week with rest days in between. More experienced users can work out 5-6 times per week. Listen to your body and ensure adequate recovery. Our app tracks your workout frequency and suggests optimal rest periods based on your activity level." = "Para principiantes recomendamos 3-4 sesiones por semana con dias de descanso. Usuarios con mas experiencia pueden entrenar 5-6 veces por semana. Escucha a tu cuerpo y asegura una buena recuperacion. La app registra tu frecuencia y sugiere descansos segun tu actividad.";
"How do I track my nutrition?" = "Como registro mi nutricion?";
"Use our built-in nutrition tracker to log meals and snacks. You can scan barcodes, search our extensive food database, or create custom meals. The app calculates calories, macronutrients, and provides insights about your eating patterns. Set goals based on your fitness objectives and track progress over time." = "Usa el registro nutricional integrado para añadir comidas y snacks. Puedes escanear codigos, buscar alimentos o crear comidas personalizadas. La app calcula calorias, macronutrientes y ofrece informacion sobre tus habitos. Define objetivos y sigue tu progreso.";
"What diet plans do you support?" = "Que planes de dieta soportan?";
"We support various diet approaches including Ketogenic, Low-Carb, Mediterranean, Intermittent Fasting, and general Calorie Deficit plans. Each plan includes meal suggestions, shopping lists, and macro targets. You can switch between plans anytime or create a custom approach that fits your lifestyle." = "Soportamos varios enfoques como keto, bajo en carbohidratos, mediterranea, ayuno intermitente y deficit calorico. Cada plan incluye sugerencias de comidas, lista de compra y objetivos de macros. Puedes cambiar de plan cuando quieras.";
"How do I change my account settings?" = "Como cambio los ajustes de mi cuenta?";
"Go to the Me tab and tap 'Settings'. Here you can update your profile information, change your password, modify notification preferences, and adjust privacy settings. Changes are automatically synced across all your devices. For email changes, you'll need to verify the new email address." = "Ve a la pestaña Me y toca Ajustes. Ahi puedes actualizar tu perfil, cambiar contraseña, modificar notificaciones y ajustar privacidad. Los cambios se sincronizan automaticamente. Para cambiar email tendras que verificar la nueva direccion.";
"How do I sync data across devices?" = "Como sincronizo datos entre dispositivos?";
"Your data automatically syncs when you're logged into the same account on multiple devices. Ensure you have a stable internet connection and the latest app version. Workout history, progress photos, and nutrition logs are stored securely in the cloud and accessible from any device." = "Tus datos se sincronizan automaticamente al iniciar sesion con la misma cuenta en varios dispositivos. Asegurate de tener internet estable y la ultima version. Historial de entrenos, fotos de progreso y registros de nutricion se guardan de forma segura en la nube.";
"What's included in the Premium subscription?" = "Que incluye la suscripcion Premium?";
"Premium includes unlimited access to all workout programs, personalized meal plans, 1-on-1 coaching sessions, advanced analytics, ad-free experience, and priority customer support. You also get exclusive content, early access to new features, and detailed progress insights with custom reports." = "Premium incluye acceso ilimitado a programas de entreno, planes de comida personalizados, sesiones 1 a 1 con entrenadores, analiticas avanzadas, experiencia sin anuncios y soporte prioritario. Tambien incluye contenido exclusivo y acceso anticipado a funciones.";
"How do I cancel my subscription?" = "Como cancelo mi suscripcion?";
"You can cancel anytime through your device's subscription settings (App Store or Google Play) or through our app in Me > Subscription > Manage. Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period. You'll retain Premium access until then and can reactivate anytime without losing your data." = "Puedes cancelar cuando quieras desde los ajustes de suscripcion del dispositivo o desde Me > Suscripcion > Gestionar. La cancelacion aplica al final del periodo actual. Mantendras Premium hasta entonces y puedes reactivar sin perder datos.";
"The app is running slowly. What should I do?" = "La app va lenta. Que debo hacer?";
"Try these steps: 1) Close and restart the app, 2) Restart your device, 3) Check for app updates in the App Store, 4) Ensure you have adequate storage space (at least 1GB free), 5) Check your internet connection. If issues persist, contact support with your device model and iOS version." = "Prueba estos pasos: 1) cierra y abre la app, 2) reinicia el dispositivo, 3) revisa actualizaciones en App Store, 4) asegúrate de tener al menos 1GB libre, 5) revisa tu conexion. Si sigue pasando, contacta soporte con tu modelo y version de iOS.";
"My workout videos won't play. Help!" = "Mis videos de entreno no se reproducen. Ayuda.";
"Video playback issues are usually related to internet connectivity. Ensure you have a stable connection (WiFi recommended for HD videos). You can also download videos for offline viewing in Settings > Downloads. Clear the app cache if videos still won't load, or try switching between WiFi and cellular data." = "Los problemas de video suelen estar relacionados con la conexion. Asegurate de tener una conexion estable, preferiblemente WiFi para HD. Tambien puedes descargar videos para verlos sin conexion. Si siguen sin cargar, limpia la cache o cambia entre WiFi y datos.";
"Is this app suitable for beginners?" = "Esta app sirve para principiantes?";
"Yes! Our app is designed for all fitness levels. We offer beginner-friendly workouts, detailed exercise instructions, form tips, and progressive programs that grow with you. The onboarding process assesses your current fitness level and creates a personalized starting point. You'll never feel overwhelmed or unsafe." = "Si. La app esta diseñada para todos los niveles. Ofrecemos entrenos para principiantes, instrucciones detalladas, consejos de tecnica y programas progresivos. El onboarding evalua tu nivel y crea un punto de partida personalizado.";
"Can I use the app without equipment?" = "Puedo usar la app sin equipo?";
"Absolutely! We have extensive bodyweight workout collections that require no equipment. Filter workouts by 'No Equipment' to find routines you can do anywhere. These include cardio, strength training, yoga, and flexibility exercises using just your body weight." = "Claro. Tenemos colecciones de entrenos con peso corporal que no requieren equipo. Filtra por Sin equipo para encontrar rutinas que puedes hacer en cualquier lugar, incluyendo cardio, fuerza, yoga y flexibilidad.";
"Based on your age, weight, height, activity level, and fitness goals, we recommend" = "Segun tu edad, peso, altura, nivel de actividad y objetivos fitness, recomendamos";
